{
 "version": 1,
 "meta": {
  "titulo": "Viga laminada con pandeo lateral-torsional — la misma viga falla con L_b = 8 m y sobra con L_b = 4 m (AISC 360-22 F1/F2, Tabla B4.1b)",
  "ficha": "struct_pad/src/content/acero/ejemplo-viga-ltb.mdx",
  "esperadoFalso": {
   "v_pasaA": "TESIS DEL EJEMPLO: con L_b = 8 m la viga NO pasa (uso 1,05). Es el punto del post — el LTB se lleva el 64 % de la capacidad de una seccion que sobra."
  }
 },
 "regions": [
  {
   "id": "r000",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 32,
   "src": "VIGA LAMINADA CON PANDEO LATERAL-TORSIONAL — la misma viga, dos esquemas de arriostramiento"
  },
  {
   "id": "r001",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 80,
   "src": "AISC 360-22 Cap. F (F1-1, F2-1 a F2-8) + Tabla B4.1b casos 10 y 15 · LRFD"
  },
  {
   "id": "r002",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 128,
   "src": "Rd_ = capacidad de diseño (incluye phi) · las comparaciones dan ✓/✗"
  },
  {
   "id": "r003",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 176,
   "src": "El caso: viga de piso simplemente apoyada de 8 m con carga distribuida. Se estudian dos"
  },
  {
   "id": "r004",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 224,
   "src": "esquemas de arriostramiento lateral del ala comprimida: solo en los apoyos (L_b = 8 m) y"
  },
  {
   "id": "r005",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 272,
   "src": "con un arriostre extra a media luz (dos tramos de L_b = 4 m). Cada cadena se calcula"
  },
  {
   "id": "r006",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 320,
   "src": "entera desde los datos: la B no se obtiene escalando el número redondeado de la A."
  },
  {
   "id": "r007",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 384,
   "src": "━━ DATOS · ACERO Y FACTORES ━━"
  },
  {
   "id": "r008",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 432,
   "src": "ASTM A992. E es el de la norma (Símbolos, Cap. F): 200 000 MPa."
  },
  {
   "id": "r009",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 480,
   "src": "F_y := 3520 kgf/cm^2"
  },
  {
   "id": "r010",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 528,
   "src": "E := 2.04e6 kgf/cm^2"
  },
  {
   "id": "r011",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 576,
   "src": "F1(a): phi_b = 0,90 para flexión (LRFD)"
  },
  {
   "id": "r012",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 624,
   "src": "phi := 0.90"
  },
  {
   "id": "r013",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 688,
   "src": "━━ DATOS · PERFIL W460×74, LAS CUATRO PLANCHAS ━━"
  },
  {
   "id": "r014",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 736,
   "src": "Dimensiones nominales del perfil métrico (catálogo). Todo lo demás se deriva de ellas:"
  },
  {
   "id": "r015",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 784,
   "src": "d := 45.7 cm"
  },
  {
   "id": "r016",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 832,
   "src": "b_f := 19.0 cm"
  },
  {
   "id": "r017",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 880,
   "src": "t_f := 1.45 cm"
  },
  {
   "id": "r018",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 928,
   "src": "t_w := 0.90 cm"
  },
  {
   "id": "r019",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 976,
   "src": "B4.1 §1b: en perfil laminado h es la luz libre MENOS los redondeos de unión. Sin"
  },
  {
   "id": "r020",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 1024,
   "src": "el dato del redondeo, d - 2·t_f es la cota SUPERIOR de h — conservadora para B4.1b."
  },
  {
   "id": "r021",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 1072,
   "src": "h_pl := d - 2*t_f = cm"
  },
  {
   "id": "r022",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 1120,
   "src": "A_pl := 2*b_f*t_f + h_pl*t_w = cm^2"
  },
  {
   "id": "r023",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 1168,
   "src": "I_xpl := (b_f*d^3 - (b_f - t_w)*h_pl^3)/12 = cm^4"
  },
  {
   "id": "r024",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 1216,
   "src": "S_xpl := I_xpl/(d/2) = cm^3"
  },
  {
   "id": "r025",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 1264,
   "src": "Z_xpl := b_f*t_f*(d - t_f) + t_w*h_pl^2/4 = cm^3"
  },
  {
   "id": "r026",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 1312,
   "src": "I_ypl := (2*t_f*b_f^3 + h_pl*t_w^3)/12 = cm^4"
  },
  {
   "id": "r027",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 1360,
   "src": "r_ypl := sqrt(I_ypl/A_pl) = cm"
  },
  {
   "id": "r028",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 1408,
   "src": "h_o es la distancia entre centroides de alas: sale EXACTA de las planchas, sin redondeos."
  },
  {
   "id": "r029",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 1456,
   "src": "h_opl := d - t_f = cm"
  },
  {
   "id": "r030",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 1504,
   "src": "Torsión y r_ts (Ec. F2-8a, con C_w = I_y·h_o²/4 del User Note de F2):"
  },
  {
   "id": "r031",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 1552,
   "src": "J_pl := (2*b_f*t_f^3 + (d - t_f)*t_w^3)/3 = cm^4"
  },
  {
   "id": "r032",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 1600,
   "src": "rts_pl := sqrt(I_ypl*h_opl/(2*S_xpl)) = cm"
  },
  {
   "id": "r033",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 1648,
   "src": "bt_ala := b_f/(2*t_f) ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r034",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 1696,
   "src": "ht_alma := h_pl/t_w ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r035",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 1760,
   "src": "━━ DATOS · PROPIEDADES TABULADAS — frontera declarada ━━"
  },
  {
   "id": "r036",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 1808,
   "src": "Z_x, S_x, r_y, r_ts, J y h_o son dato de tabla de perfiles, no de la norma: la"
  },
  {
   "id": "r037",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 1856,
   "src": "Specification no tabula perfiles. El ejemplo los declara y la planilla los usa tal"
  },
  {
   "id": "r038",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 1904,
   "src": "cual. Lo que sí verifica es que las cuatro planchas reproduzcan la fila."
  },
  {
   "id": "r039",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 1952,
   "src": "Z_x := 1655 cm^3"
  },
  {
   "id": "r040",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 2000,
   "src": "S_x := 1457 cm^3"
  },
  {
   "id": "r041",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 2048,
   "src": "r_y := 4.19 cm"
  },
  {
   "id": "r042",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 2096,
   "src": "r_ts := 5.03 cm"
  },
  {
   "id": "r043",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 2144,
   "src": "J := 51.6 cm^4"
  },
  {
   "id": "r044",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 2192,
   "src": "h_o := 44.2 cm"
  },
  {
   "id": "r045",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 2240,
   "src": "F2-8b: para perfil I doblemente simétrico, c = 1"
  },
  {
   "id": "r046",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 2288,
   "src": "c := 1"
  },
  {
   "id": "r047",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 2336,
   "src": "Contraste planchas ↔ tabla, con TOLERANCIA DECLARADA: las planchas no llevan los"
  },
  {
   "id": "r048",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 2384,
   "src": "redondeos de unión ala-alma, así que dan menos área, menos módulo y menos J."
  },
  {
   "id": "r049",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 2432,
   "src": "dif_Zx := Z_xpl/Z_x - 1 ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r050",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 2480,
   "src": "dif_Sx := S_xpl/S_x - 1 ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r051",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 2528,
   "src": "dif_J := J_pl/J - 1 ="
  },
  {
   "id": "v_zxpl",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 2576,
   "src": "abs(dif_Zx) < 0.02 ="
  },
  {
   "id": "v_sxpl",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 2624,
   "src": "abs(dif_Sx) < 0.02 ="
  },
  {
   "id": "v_rypl",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 2672,
   "src": "abs(r_ypl/r_y - 1) < 0.01 ="
  },
  {
   "id": "v_rtspl",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 2720,
   "src": "abs(rts_pl/r_ts - 1) < 0.01 ="
  },
  {
   "id": "v_jpl",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 2768,
   "src": "abs(dif_J) < 0.05 ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r052",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 2816,
   "src": "h_o no lleva tolerancia de redondeo: d - t_f es la definición. Los 44,2 cm de tabla"
  },
  {
   "id": "r053",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 2864,
   "src": "son los 17,4 in truncados; d - t_f da 44,25."
  },
  {
   "id": "v_hopl",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 2912,
   "src": "abs(h_opl - h_o) < 0.06 cm ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r054",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 2960,
   "src": "El ala no tiene redondeos: b_f/2t_f de las planchas debe dar el de la tabla."
  },
  {
   "id": "v_btpl",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 3008,
   "src": "abs(bt_ala/6.57 - 1) < 0.005 ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r055",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 3056,
   "src": "El alma sí: la cota d - 2t_f queda POR ENCIMA del h/t_w tabulado, como debe ser."
  },
  {
   "id": "v_htpl",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 3104,
   "src": "ht_alma > 45.2 ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r056",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 3168,
   "src": "━━ DATOS · GEOMETRÍA Y CARGA ━━"
  },
  {
   "id": "r057",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 3216,
   "src": "L := 800 cm"
  },
  {
   "id": "r058",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 3264,
   "src": "w := 2.5 tonf/m"
  },
  {
   "id": "r059",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 3312,
   "src": "M_u := w*L^2/8 = tonf*m"
  },
  {
   "id": "r060",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 3376,
   "src": "━━ 1 · CLASIFICACIÓN DE LA SECCIÓN (Tabla B4.1b) ━━"
  },
  {
   "id": "r061",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 3424,
   "src": "Caso 10 (alas de perfiles I laminados) y caso 15 (almas de perfiles I doblemente"
  },
  {
   "id": "r062",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 3472,
   "src": "simétricos). Es la tabla de FLEXIÓN — no la B4.1a, que es la de compresión."
  },
  {
   "id": "r063",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 3520,
   "src": "lam_pf := 0.38*sqrt(E/F_y) ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r064",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 3568,
   "src": "lam_pw := 3.76*sqrt(E/F_y) ="
  },
  {
   "id": "v_ala",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 3616,
   "src": "bt_ala < lam_pf ="
  },
  {
   "id": "v_alma",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 3664,
   "src": "ht_alma < lam_pw ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r065",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 3712,
   "src": "Ambos compactos, y el alma con la cota conservadora: aplica la Sección F2 completa."
  },
  {
   "id": "r066",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 3776,
   "src": "━━ 2 · LA META DÚCTIL: MOMENTO PLÁSTICO (Ec. F2-1) ━━"
  },
  {
   "id": "r067",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 3824,
   "src": "M_p := F_y*Z_x = tonf*m"
  },
  {
   "id": "r068",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 3872,
   "src": "Rd_p := phi*M_p = tonf*m"
  },
  {
   "id": "r069",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 3920,
   "src": "u_p := M_u/Rd_p ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r070",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 3968,
   "src": "El momento plástico sobra por lejos: el problema no es de resistencia de la sección."
  },
  {
   "id": "r071",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4032,
   "src": "━━ 3 · LAS DOS LONGITUDES LÍMITE (Ec. F2-5 y F2-6) ━━"
  },
  {
   "id": "r072",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4080,
   "src": "L_p := 1.76*r_y*sqrt(E/F_y) = cm"
  },
  {
   "id": "r073",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4128,
   "src": "El término Jc/(S_x·h_o) que se repite dentro de F2-6 y de F2-4:"
  },
  {
   "id": "r074",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4176,
   "src": "rz := J*c/(S_x*h_o) ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r075",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4224,
   "src": "L_r := 1.95*r_ts*(E/(0.7*F_y))*sqrt(rz + sqrt(rz^2 + 6.76*(0.7*F_y/E)^2)) = cm"
  },
  {
   "id": "v_orden",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4288,
   "src": "L_p < L_r ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r076",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4352,
   "src": "━━ 4 · EL DIAGRAMA DE MOMENTOS ━━"
  },
  {
   "id": "r077",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4400,
   "src": "Viga simplemente apoyada con carga uniforme: la parábola M(x) = w·x·(L-x)/2. De acá"
  },
  {
   "id": "r078",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4448,
   "src": "salen los momentos en los cuartos que pide la Ec. F1-1 — no se citan, se evalúan."
  },
  {
   "id": "r079",
   "kind": "program",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4496,
   "src": "M(x) := w*x*(L - x)/2"
  },
  {
   "id": "r080",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4528,
   "src": "M_max := M(L/2) = tonf*m"
  },
  {
   "id": "v_mmax",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4576,
   "src": "abs(M_max - M_u) < 0.0001 tonf*m ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r081",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4640,
   "src": "━━ 5 · CASO A: ARRIOSTRADA SOLO EN LOS APOYOS (L_b = 8 m) ━━"
  },
  {
   "id": "r082",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4688,
   "src": "L_bA := 800 cm"
  },
  {
   "id": "v_zonaA",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4736,
   "src": "L_bA > L_r ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r083",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4784,
   "src": "Zona de pandeo ELÁSTICO: se vuelca sin haber fluido."
  },
  {
   "id": "r084",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4832,
   "src": "C_b por la Ec. F1-1, con los cuartos del tramo 0-8 m evaluados en la parábola:"
  },
  {
   "id": "r085",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4880,
   "src": "MA_A := M(200 cm) = tonf*m"
  },
  {
   "id": "r086",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4928,
   "src": "MB_A := M(400 cm) = tonf*m"
  },
  {
   "id": "r087",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4976,
   "src": "MC_A := M(600 cm) = tonf*m"
  },
  {
   "id": "r088",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5024,
   "src": "Mmx_A := M(400 cm) = tonf*m"
  },
  {
   "id": "r089",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5072,
   "src": "C_bA := 12.5*Mmx_A/(2.5*Mmx_A + 3*MA_A + 4*MB_A + 3*MC_A) ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r090",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5120,
   "src": "Ec. F2-4: la parte de Euler del ala comprimida, primero sin el crédito C_b."
  },
  {
   "id": "r091",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5168,
   "src": "esb_A := L_bA/r_ts ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r092",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5216,
   "src": "q_A := esb_A^2 ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r093",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5264,
   "src": "F_cr1 := pi^2*E/q_A*sqrt(1 + 0.078*rz*q_A) = kgf/cm^2"
  },
  {
   "id": "r094",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5312,
   "src": "El crédito C_b entra sobre la tensión crítica de precisión completa, no sobre la redondeada:"
  },
  {
   "id": "r095",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5360,
   "src": "F_crA := C_bA*F_cr1 = kgf/cm^2"
  },
  {
   "id": "r096",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5408,
   "src": "Ec. F2-3, con su tope M_p:"
  },
  {
   "id": "r097",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5456,
   "src": "MnA_0 := F_crA*S_x = tonf*m"
  },
  {
   "id": "v_topeA",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5504,
   "src": "MnA_0 < M_p ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r098",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5552,
   "src": "M_nA := min(MnA_0, M_p) = tonf*m"
  },
  {
   "id": "r099",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5600,
   "src": "Rd_A := phi*M_nA = tonf*m"
  },
  {
   "id": "r100",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5648,
   "src": "u_A := M_u/Rd_A ="
  },
  {
   "id": "v_pasaA",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5696,
   "src": "u_A <= 1 ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r101",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5744,
   "src": "NO PASA — y es la tesis del ejemplo. La magnitud del robo del LTB:"
  },
  {
   "id": "r102",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5792,
   "src": "robo := (1 - Rd_A/Rd_p)*100 ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r103",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5840,
   "src": "Sin tomar el crédito por gradiente (C_b = 1,0) sería todavía menor:"
  },
  {
   "id": "r104",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5888,
   "src": "Rd_A1 := phi*F_cr1*S_x = tonf*m"
  },
  {
   "id": "r105",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5952,
   "src": "━━ 6 · CASO B: UN ARRIOSTRE A MEDIA LUZ (L_b = 4 m) ━━"
  },
  {
   "id": "r106",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6000,
   "src": "L_bB := 400 cm"
  },
  {
   "id": "v_zonaB1",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6048,
   "src": "L_bB > L_p ="
  },
  {
   "id": "v_zonaB2",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6096,
   "src": "L_bB <= L_r ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r107",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6144,
   "src": "Zona de pandeo INELÁSTICO: la recta que baja entre M_p y 0,7·F_y·S_x."
  },
  {
   "id": "r108",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6192,
   "src": "El tramo crítico va del apoyo (M = 0) al centro (M = M_max): gradiente fuerte, C_b mayor."
  },
  {
   "id": "r109",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6240,
   "src": "Cuartos del tramo 0-4 m, y su M_max, que cae en el extremo del tramo:"
  },
  {
   "id": "r110",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6288,
   "src": "MA_B := M(100 cm) = tonf*m"
  },
  {
   "id": "r111",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6336,
   "src": "MB_B := M(200 cm) = tonf*m"
  },
  {
   "id": "r112",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6384,
   "src": "MC_B := M(300 cm) = tonf*m"
  },
  {
   "id": "r113",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6432,
   "src": "Mmx_B := M(400 cm) = tonf*m"
  },
  {
   "id": "r114",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6480,
   "src": "C_bB := 12.5*Mmx_B/(2.5*Mmx_B + 3*MA_B + 4*MB_B + 3*MC_B) ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r115",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6528,
   "src": "Ec. F2-2, con todos sus operandos a precisión completa:"
  },
  {
   "id": "r116",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6576,
   "src": "M_07 := 0.7*F_y*S_x = tonf*m"
  },
  {
   "id": "r117",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6624,
   "src": "dM := M_p - M_07 = tonf*m"
  },
  {
   "id": "r118",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6672,
   "src": "frac := (L_bB - L_p)/(L_r - L_p) ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r119",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6720,
   "src": "corch := M_p - dM*frac = tonf*m"
  },
  {
   "id": "r120",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6768,
   "src": "MnB_0 := C_bB*corch = tonf*m"
  },
  {
   "id": "v_topeB",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6816,
   "src": "MnB_0 < M_p ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r121",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6864,
   "src": "M_nB := min(MnB_0, M_p) = tonf*m"
  },
  {
   "id": "r122",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6912,
   "src": "Rd_B := phi*M_nB = tonf*m"
  },
  {
   "id": "r123",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6960,
   "src": "u_B := M_u/Rd_B ="
  },
  {
   "id": "v_pasaB",
